# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback. Every request that doesn't match a
# static asset gets rewritten to /index.html with a 200, so client-side
# routes like /about, /browse, /m/:slug, /r/:postalCode work when typed
# directly into the address bar or hit by an external link. Without
# this, Pages serves its default 404 for any non-asset path.
#
# Pages-specific rule format docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

/*    /index.html   200
